      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.03,
      325.41,
      526.0,
      338.69
    ],
    "text": "The Petitioner makes a serious complaint against the Respondents whose actions and inactions",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.03,
      353.16,
      526.07,
      366.44
    ],
    "text": "not only affect the Petitioner, but also affects the entire environment, ecology, culture, and the",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.03,
      380.68,
      150.33,
      393.96
    ],
    "text": "Nation in total.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.03,
      416.18,
      525.89,
      429.46
    ],
    "text": "After issuance of formal notice, the Respondents filed their Objections, and thereafter, this was",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.03,
      443.93,
      345.4,
      457.21
    ],
